                <span style={{ width: 16, height: 16, borderRadius: "50%", border: "1px solid #475569", display: "inline-flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", fontSize: "10px", fontWeight: 700, color: "#64748b", flexShrink: 0 }}>?</span>
